# Data Model

## Objective

Create a star schema to improve dashboard performance and simplify reporting.

---

## Fact Table

FactSales

Contains:

- Order ID
- Order Date
- Product ID
- Customer ID
- Sales
- Profit
- Quantity
- Discount

---

## Dimension Tables

### DimCustomer

- Customer ID
- Customer Name
- Segment

### DimProduct

- Product ID
- Product Name
- Category
- Sub-Category

### DimRegion

- Region
- State
- City

### DimDate

- Date
- Month
- Quarter
- Year

---

## Relationships

DimCustomer → FactSales

DimProduct → FactSales

DimRegion → FactSales

DimDate → FactSales

Relationship Type:

One-to-Many
